Package: opus-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Opus codec command line tools, built from upstream master
 The Xiph.Org reference tools for Ogg Opus, built from git master of
 https://gitlab.xiph.org/xiph/opus-tools rather than the 2018 v0.2 release:
  * opusenc  - encode WAV, AIFF, FLAC or raw PCM to Ogg Opus;
  * opusdec  - decode Ogg Opus to WAV or raw PCM, or play it;
  * opusinfo - inspect and validate Ogg Opus files;
  * opusrtp  - send Ogg Opus as RTP, or extract Opus RTP from a live
               interface or a pcap file into a playable file.
 .
 Unlike the distribution package, this one includes opusrtp.
